<%# Action Text's own partial wraps this in <figure class="attachment attachment--content">.
    Lexxy reads the rendered form back as the node's content and writes it to the body on
    the next save, so every editor load grew one more wrapper around each embed (post 76
    reached ten). Unwrapped, a render is a fixed point: the content comes out as it went in. %>
<%= content_attachment.attachable -%>
